OL,3,GNEWSACouncil set for U-turn on beauty
OL,4,Aspot sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial proposals to sell part of
OL,7,Fa Worcestershire beauty spot to a
OL,8,Ffootball club have been all-but
OL,9,Fabandoned after a public outcry.
OL,11,FWyre Forest District Council has
OL,12,Fchanged its mind over the principle of
OL,13,Fselling a fifth of Burlish Country Park
OL,14,Fto Kidderminster Harriers Football
OL,15,FClub.
OL,17,FThe U-turn comes after it received 650
OL,18,Fobjections to the plan during a
OL,19,Fstatutory notice period.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
