OL,3,GNEWSACouncil set for U-turn on beauty
OL,4,Aspot sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Marcus Hart, their leader,
OL,7,Fsaid: "This was not a referendum, but
OL,8,Fthe objections, representations and
OL,9,Fissues raised through the statutory
OL,10,Fprocess have been taken seriously." The
OL,11,FBBC has contacted Kidderminster
OL,12,FHarriers for comment.
